# Quality checks

Before declaring any task done, run the project's real gates from the repository root and fix reported errors.

Replace the examples below. Do not leave placeholder commands in a production service repo.

```bash
# Documentation (if this standard's linter is wired)
make docs-validate

# Examples — keep only what this repo actually runs:
# uv run ruff check .
# uv run pytest tests/unit/ -q
# uv run pyright .
# ./gradlew test
```

## Exit criteria

| Tool | Criterion |
| --- | --- |
| Docs validate | No ERROR on governed docs |
| Lint / tests / types | The project's existing bar (do not invent a new one) |
